# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary, preferably <=72 characters>
# Types: feat, fix, refactor, perf, test, docs, build, ci, chore, revert
# One independently reviewable change. Explain the problem and resulting behavior.

# Validation: exact commands actually run and their results; note unrun checks.
# Risk / migration: relevant compatibility, storage or deployment implications.
# Refs: #issue-number (only when the issue exists)
# BREAKING CHANGE: describe incompatible changes and migration, when applicable.
